-- Decree 67/2023/NĐ-CP, Articles 18 to 22: the governance, organisation and accounts of the
-- Motor Vehicle Insurance Fund. Only what creates a right or a duty of a policyholder, a victim
-- or an insurer is encoded: the annual settlement report owed to the insurers (Article 18(2))
-- and the budget notified to them (Article 21(1)(b) and (d)). Article 20(1)(d) is encoded with
-- Article 16(2), 20(1)(k) with Article 17(1)(a), and 20(2)(c) with Article 16(3). The rest is in
-- NOTES.md §2 as out of scope, with its reason.
-- DECREE 220/2026 does not amend Articles 18-22: one rule answers for both vintages.

§ `Articles 18 to 22 — governing the Fund`

§§ `Article 18(1) — the organs of the Fund`

-- Out of scope: the Management Council, the Executive Board, the Supervisory Board and the
-- Fund's Office; the Council is set up by the Minister of Finance on the Association's proposal.
-- It gives no person harmed, policyholder or insurer a right.
