§§ `Article 18(2) — the annual settlement report, owed to the insurers`

-- The Fund's annual settlement report, confirmed by an independent auditor, must be sent to
-- the Ministry of Finance and to the insurers before 31 March of the next year, and published
-- in full, with the auditor's opinion, on the Vietnam Insurance Association's website.
-- Fork V17: the sentence is passive and names no sender. Article 21(3) makes the Executive
--   Board prepare the settlement report, so the Board is taken as the party. "Trước ngày 31
--   tháng 3" (before 31 March: last day 30 March, fork V2) is read with the sending only; the
--   publication has no period of its own.
