-- src:694 | quyết toán Quỹ bảo hiểm xe cơ giới, có xác nhận của kiểm toán độc lập để báo cáo
-- src:695 | Hội đồng Quản lý Quỹ bảo hiểm xe cơ giới phê duyệt.
@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 18(2); forks V2, V17
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DATE
`Article 18(2) — the last day to send the settlement report for` y MEANS
    `the last day before` (YMD (y PLUS 1) 3 31)

-- THE CLOCK of this rule is the date serial: a trace starts `AT (DATE_SERIAL (YMD …))`.
@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 18(2); fork V17
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC `A party under Articles 16 to 22, 62 and 75` `An act under Articles 16 to 22, 62 and 75`
`Article 18(2) — the settlement report for` y MEANS
        (PARTY  `the Fund's Executive Board`
         MUST   `send the audited annual settlement report to the Ministry of Finance and the insurers`
         BEFORE (`Article 18(2) — the last day to send the settlement report for` y)
         HENCE  FULFILLED
         LEST   BREACH BY `the Fund's Executive Board`
                BECAUSE "Article 18(2): the audited settlement report was not sent to the Ministry of Finance and the insurers before 31 March")
    RAND
        (PARTY  `the Fund's Executive Board`
         MUST   `publish the whole audited annual settlement report on the Association's website`
         HENCE  FULFILLED
         LEST   BREACH BY `the Fund's Executive Board`
                BECAUSE "Article 18(2): the audited settlement report was not published in full on the Association's website")

§§ `Article 19 — the composition of the organs`

-- Out of scope: who sits on the Council, the Executive Board and the Supervisory Board (among
-- them at least three insurers with the largest market share). It decides no claim and gives
-- no policyholder or person harmed a right.
-- src:579 | Điều 19. Cơ cấu tổ chức, quản trị điều hành của Quỹ bảo hiểm xe cơ giới
-- src:580 | 1. Hội đồng Quản lý Quỹ bảo hiểm xe cơ giới bao gồm:

§§ `Article 20 — the tasks and powers of the organs`

-- Point (1)(d), the contribution rate, is encoded with Article 16(2); point (1)(k), the process
-- and file for humanitarian support and repayment, is a named refusal with Article 17(1)(a);
-- point (2)(c), recourse against an insurer that pays late or short, is encoded with Article
-- 16(3). The rest (responsibility, internal rules, the database, supervision) is out of scope.
