§§ `Article 21(1)(b), (d) — the budget, notified to the insurers`

-- (b) The Executive Board reports the Fund's budget of receipts and spending for the Council to
-- approve; the budget "phải được thông báo cho Bộ Tài chính và các doanh nghiệp bảo hiểm ngay
-- sau khi phê duyệt" (must be notified to the Ministry of Finance and the insurers immediately
-- after approval). The sentence names no notifier: the Executive Board, which reports the
-- budget, is taken as the party (fork V17). (d) Where necessary the Council may adjust the
-- budget, and then notifies the Ministry and the insurers itself.
-- No period in days is given for either, and none is invented (fork V22).
-- The rest of Article 21 (preparing the budget, carrying unspent plans over, the accounts and
-- the quarterly report to the Ministry) is out of scope.
