GIVETH A DEONTIC `A party under Articles 16 to 22, 62 and 75` `An act under Articles 16 to 22, 62 and 75`
`Article 21(1)(b) — the approved budget must be notified to the insurers` MEANS
    PARTY `the Fund's Executive Board`
    MUST  `notify the budget, once approved or adjusted, to the Ministry of Finance and the insurers`
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST  BREACH BY `the Fund's Executive Board`
          BECAUSE "Article 21(1)(b): the approved budget was not notified to the Ministry of Finance and the insurers"

@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 21(1)(d); fork V22
GIVETH A DEONTIC `A party under Articles 16 to 22, 62 and 75` `An act under Articles 16 to 22, 62 and 75`
`Article 21(1)(d) — an adjusted budget must be notified to the insurers` MEANS
    PARTY `the Fund's Management Council`
    MUST  `notify the budget, once approved or adjusted, to the Ministry of Finance and the insurers`
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST  BREACH BY `the Fund's Management Council`
          BECAUSE "Article 21(1)(d): the adjusted budget was not notified to the Ministry of Finance and the insurers"

§§ `Article 22 — setting up the Council`

-- Out of scope: the procedure by which the Association and the Council apply to the Ministry
-- of Finance to set up the Council or change its members (the Minister decides within 10
-- days), with the forms of Annexes VIII and IX.
